  "layout": "landscape",
  "prompt": "Create a high-resolution, photorealistic landscape hero image for an internal sustainability report. Scene: a modern office rooftop covered with multiple rows of solar panels at sunrise. Style: clean editorial photography, natural warm golden-hour lighting, soft but crisp details, realistic reflections on panel surfaces, no text or logos. Composition: wide panoramic view with leading lines of solar panel rows guiding toward the sunrise on the horizon; include a subtle modern city skyline in the background, slightly out of focus for depth. Rooftop details: visible mounting racks, inverter boxes, and tasteful low planters with green vegetation to convey sustainability, but keep scene uncluttered. Atmosphere: clear sky with gentle gradient from warm orange near horizon to pale blue above, soft lens flare from low sun, calm and optimistic mood. Color palette: warm golds and cool blues, neutral modern architecture tones. Camera: wide-angle (24mm equivalent), moderate aperture for overall sharpness (f/8), natural looking shadows and reflections, high dynamic range to preserve detail in highlights and shadows. Absolute requirements: no people, no signage or text, no visible brand logos, photorealistic editorial style suitable as a hero image. Output: landscape 16:9 composition, high detail, ready for use as report hero image."
}
